{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31487","headline":"龙山人惠石廪方及团茶 · 李羣玉","name":"龙山人惠石廪方及团茶","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"客有衡岳隐，遗余石廪茶。\n自云凌烟露，采掇春山芽。\n珪璧相压叠，积芳莫能加。\n碾成黄金粉，轻嫩如松花。\n红鑪爨霜枝，越儿斟井华。\n滩声起鱼眼，满鼎漂清霞。\n凝澄坐晓灯，病眼如蒙纱。\n一瓯拂昏寐，襟鬲开烦拏。\n顾渚与方山，谁人留品差。\n持瓯默吟味，摇膝空咨嗟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李羣玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31487.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31487","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}